/C [ 0 0 0 ]
/Contents (Introduce the subject through public architecture\056 The main appraisal concerns the National Congress in Bras\355lia\054 with comparative cases in Pampulha\054 Niter\363i and Ibirapuera\056 The syllabus focus is ART 501 Module V\054 CO4 and CO5\072 reading urban layers and critically appraising an urban public project for S9 design studio\056 Suggested delivery\072 about 18\20522 minutes\056 Photographs document real buildings\056 Interactive diagrams explain relationships and are labelled as schematics\056)
/QuadPoints [ 1240 775 1241 775 1240 776 1241 776 ]
/Rect [ 1240 775 1241 776 ]
/Subtype /Text
/Type /Annot
/F 32
>>
endobj
