<<
/C [ 0 0 0 ]
/Contents (The syllabus\054 supplied PDF pp\0562\2056\054 connects the public\055project case study to the different urban\055design dimensions\056 Morphology concerns the arrangement of buildings and spaces\056 Perception concerns orientation and the sequence of experience\056 Social reading asks who can use a space and under what conditions\056 Visual reading examines composition\056 Functional reading asks how programme and movement work\056 The dimensions overlap\056 A good case study connects them rather than assigning a building a score based on appearance\056)
/QuadPoints [ 1240 775 1241 775 1240 776 1241 776 ]
/Rect [ 1240 775 1241 776 ]
/Subtype /Text
/Type /Annot
/F 32
>>
