/Contents (Keep the biography short so the urban appraisal remains central\056 Niemeyer expanded modernism\220s structural and spatial experiments through sculptural concrete forms\056 The Pritzker Prize honoured Niemeyer and Gordon Bunshaft in 1988\056 Bras\355lia brought Niemeyer\220s civic buildings into a city plan by L\372cio Costa\056 Later international commissions demonstrate the reach of his career\056 The interpretation about urban image will be tested through actual project relationships on the following slides\056)
