/C [ 0 0 0 ]
/Contents (The Cathedral illustrates the relationship between structure and image\056 It also invites a spatial reading rather than a fa\347ade\055only description\056 A photograph can support visual analysis\054 but thermal performance\054 inclusive access and the actual visitor sequence require more detailed evidence\056 Concrete permits many forms\054 yet those forms rely on structural engineering\054 construction and maintenance\056 Avoid treating every Niemeyer curve as a thin shell or assuming that a shape alone guarantees structural efficiency\056)
/QuadPoints [ 1240 775 1241 775 1240 776 1241 776 ]
/Rect [ 1240 775 1241 776 ]
/Subtype /Text
/Type /Annot
/F 32
>>
endobj
