/Contents (These examples establish a range rather than an exhaustive catalogue\056 Pampulha\220s ensemble began with a 1940 garden\055city commission\056 The Ibirapuera park opened in 1954\054 with architecture by Niemeyer and collaborators\056 Bras\355lia\220s Congress opened in 1960\056 The MAC opened in 1996\056 Public architecture includes civic institutions\054 cultural buildings and the spaces that connect them\056 The selected comparisons focus on open space\054 approach and opportunities for public use\056)
/QuadPoints [ 1240 775 1241 775 1240 776 1241 776 ]
