/C [ 0 0 0 ]
/Contents (Do not credit Niemeyer alone with Bras\355lia\220s master plan\056 Costa\220s Plano Piloto and Niemeyer\220s architecture work together at the monumental scale\056 The national\055capital project also depended on a broad technical and labour network\056 Urban performance follows from planning\054 infrastructure\054 policy and management as well as architecture\056 Keep that distinction when discussing transport and metropolitan inequality\056)
