/Contents (The convex dome is the Senate\056 The upturned or concave bowl is the Chamber of Deputies\056 The twin towers accommodate offices\056 The official Chamber page identifies two 28\055storey towers\056 The contrasting forms distinguish the legislature\220s components in the city\220s image\056 This diagram explains their composition and should not be mistaken for a measured elevation\054 an exact chamber floor plan or a shell structural analysis\056)
