/Contents (Use the layers to make the figure\055ground relationship visible\056 Dark shapes are institutions\056 The pale ground represents open space\056 Roads and the dotted approach are analytical layers\056 Their simplified arrangement cannot establish crossing locations or accessibility\056 The appraisal concerns the balance between a freestanding monument and the spaces around it\056 The question about usable edges needs observational testing at ground level\056)
