/C [ 0 0 0 ]
/Contents (The Cathedral provides a contrasting civic or religious public experience within Bras\355lia\056 It demonstrates a change from distant silhouette to enclosed space\056 The 1970 completion date follows the Pritzker selected works list\056 The general statement about sequence is analysis\056 Avoid repeating structural counts or specific access dimensions unless you have measured drawings\056 The lesson is relevant to a public studio project whose entrance must be understandable from outside and usable at close range\056)
