110 0 obj
<<
/C [ 0 0 0 ]
/Contents (UNESCO documents four buildings around an artificial lake\054 designed by Niemeyer with engineer Joaquim Cardozo and artists including Portinari\056 Burle Marx\220s gardens and walkable spaces reinforce the dialogue with the landscape\056 This comparison shifts the discussion from the capital\220s civic axis to an ensemble within a garden\055city context\056 The site received World Heritage inscription in 2016\056 The photograph shows one part of the ensemble\056 It does not establish the accessibility or present\055day water quality of the entire lake\056)
/QuadPoints [ 1240 775 1241 775 1240 776 1241 776 ]
