118 0 obj
<<
/C [ 0 0 0 ]
/Contents (Municipal tourism records the opening on 2 September 1996\056 The Brazilian Institute of Museums describes the plaza\054 reflecting pool\054 red ramp and galleries\056 Avoid equating a ramp\220s visual presence with accessibility compliance\056 The shape depends on structural collaboration\056 Niemeyer\220s own discussion published by Pritzker explains how the central\055support idea evolved to include additional functions\056 The project\220s public role also connects to a larger waterfront cultural route\054 but this presentation appraises the museum rather than claiming a comprehensive assessment of that route\056)
/QuadPoints [ 1240 775 1241 775 1240 776 1241 776 ]
/Rect [ 1240 775 1241 776 ]
/Subtype /Text
/Type /Annot
/F 32
>>
endobj
