/Contents (Use this comparison to explain transferable design principles without copying shapes\056 The projects offer different spatial relationships\072 monument\054 ensemble\054 coastal landmark and covered connector\056 Their public value cannot be reduced to a common form language\056 Each needs an assessment appropriate to programme\054 setting and users\056 The questions are a research agenda for fieldwork rather than claims that all four spaces perform equally well\056)
