140 0 obj
<<
/C [ 0 0 0 ]
/Contents (The critique should be specific and proportional\056 UNESCO identifies transport pressure and social\055spatial segregation in the Bras\355lia metropolitan context\056 That evidence concerns the larger urban system\054 not a controlled test of the Congress design\056 The challenges of exposed space and monumental distance are design questions that require local observation\056 Distinguish the architectural achievement from city\055wide policy and infrastructure\056 Structural maintenance is a lifecycle responsibility demonstrated by the Ibirapuera conservation record\056)
/QuadPoints [ 1240 775 1241 775 1240 776 1241 776 ]
/Rect [ 1240 775 1241 776 ]
/Subtype /Text
/Type /Annot
/F 32
>>
