/C [ 0 0 0 ]
/Contents (This conclusion addresses CO4 and CO5 and the Module V task of appraising a public architecture project for S9 design studio\056 Useful methods from Module IV include imageability\054 permeability and visual analysis\054 figure\055ground and activity mapping\054 and a pedestrian catchment study\056 The checklist is a teaching aid\054 not a claim that the syllabus prescribes these exact five items\056 Site documentation should include a method\054 a date and a limitation\056 Do not insert fabricated field counts or measured distances\056)
